  "body": "Resort-Style Living with Stunning Pool\r\n\r\nExperience the pinnacle of seaside luxury in this architecturally designed residence, perfectly positioned in one of Murrays Bay’s most prestigious coastal streets. Elevated to capture sweeping sea views and nestled beside a tranquil reserve, this exceptional home offers privacy, elegance, and effortless family living.\r\n\r\nDesigned with both entertaining and relaxation in mind, the home features expansive open-plan living areas that seamlessly connect to sun-soaked outdoor spaces and a stunning private pool — ideal for children, avid swimmers, or hosting unforgettable summer gatherings.\r\n\r\nBoasting four generously sized bedrooms and four luxurious ensuites, every family member and guest enjoys their own private retreat. Sophisticated interiors are enhanced by solid timber flooring, and ambient LED lighting throughout.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home lies a designer kitchen complete with premium granite benchtops, integrated Miele appliances, bespoke cabinetry, and a fully equipped scullery — crafted for those who appreciate quality and style.\r\n\r\nThe home’s striking exterior showcases premium, low-maintenance Interlocking Panel Architectural Steel Cladding manufactured from high-quality NZ Steel materials. Designed for durability and contemporary coastal living, these finishes provide exceptional weather resistance while maintaining a refined modern aesthetic year-round.\r\n\r\nPremium Features Include:\r\n\r\n• Private swimming pool with beautiful sea views\r\n• Direct private walkway to Churchill Cove Beach and reserve\r\n• Multiple light-filled living and entertaining areas\r\n• Secure gated entry with video intercom system\r\n• CCTV surveillance and monitored alarm system\r\n• Striking Plexiglass garage door\r\n• Maintenance-free Interlocking Panel Architectural Steel Cladding using premium NZ Steel materials\r\n• Super Seam Architectural Steel Roofing\r\n• Luxury finishes and contemporary architectural design\r\n\r\nPositioned in an unbeatable coastal location, enjoy morning walks to the beach, peaceful reserve-side living, and easy access to some of the North Shore’s most sought-after schools, including Murrays Bay Primary School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure an exceptional lifestyle property in the heart of the Bays.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit the next open home.",
